research/audit/wave6-dispatch/audit-beta-topology.log-60054-+ ("lem-straight-line-homotopies-are-continuous","ai-altered","ai-generated","semantic-source",[UCR_HOMOTOPY],"The UC Riverside notes use the same straight-line formula for maps into a convex Euclidean subset. This item separately discharges continuity into the subspace codomain and therefore is a detailed semantic expansion."),
